# sriq ABox split (slice 9j): a consistent property-assertion component, beside a folded individual
# whose type is unsatisfiable (D ⊑ ⊥ through D ⊑ E, E ⊑ ¬D). The hierarchy run's hidden class finds it.
# Expect: inconsistent.
@prefix :     <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .

:B a owl:Class . :D a owl:Class . :E a owl:Class . :r a owl:ObjectProperty .
:D rdfs:subClassOf :E . :E rdfs:subClassOf [ owl:complementOf :D ] .
:a a owl:NamedIndividual ; :r :b .
:b a owl:NamedIndividual , :B .
:d a owl:NamedIndividual , :D .
